      "score": 36,
      "comments": 3,
      "author": "yoelcabo",
      "published": "2026-08-06T11:22:20Z",
      "bullets": [
        "AI meeting recorder tl;dv exposed 181,874 recorded calls due to broken object-level authorization and missing API access controls.",
        "Unauthenticated endpoints allowed external access to sensitive enterprise audio, transcripts, and metadata across Zoom, Google Meet, and Teams.",
        "Security teams must restrict third-party AI bot integrations, audit SaaS OAuth scopes, and mandate strict API authorization testing."
      ]
    },
